flowchart TD
  A[Authenticated customer selects service/provider] --> B[Request future availability]
  B --> C{Slot selected?}
  C -- No --> B
  C -- Yes --> D[POST booking]
  D --> E{Service/provider exist and slot free?}
  E -- No --> F[4xx safe error; no write]
  E -- Yes --> G[Commit confirmed booking]
  G --> H[Return 201 and show My appointments]
